playwright-rs (vendored)
========================

This directory contains a vendored copy of `playwright-rs` version 0.13.0,
originally authored by Paul Adamson and distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see the accompanying LICENSE file).

Upstream source: https://github.com/padamson/playwright-rust

Local modifications
-------------------
This copy has been modified from the upstream release. Per Apache-2.0 §4(b),
the changes are:

  * build.rs — the Playwright Node.js driver download now verifies a pinned
    SHA-256 checksum of each platform's driver ZIP before extraction
    (supply-chain integrity anchor). The unmodified upstream downloads the
    archive without checksum verification.

  * src/server/driver.rs — driver-resolution order reordered so a runtime
    PLAYWRIGHT_NODE_EXE / PLAYWRIGHT_CLI_JS override takes priority over the
    crate's bundled vanilla driver (lets the host point the driver at the
    patchright stealth driver).

All other files are redistributed unmodified.
